OL,3,AEngland's mayors to get power to impose
OL,4,Atourist tax
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut the government said it would
OL,7,Fprotect budget holidays "by making sure
OL,8,Flow-cost accommodation always pays
OL,9,Flowest levy" and said the extra cash
OL,10,Fcould be invested in high streets and
OL,11,Flocal transport.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
