OL,3,A'It blew me away': First visitors see
OL,4,ABayeux Tapestry as London exhibition
OL,5,Aopens
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Bayeux Tapestry is on public
OL,8,Fdisplay in the UK for the first time
OL,9,Fsince it was created nearly 1,000 years
OL,10,Fago
OL,12,FThe roughly 70m-long (230ft) tapestry
OL,13,Fhas been inspiring artists since the
OL,14,FMiddle Ages - one man spent 40 years
OL,15,Fcross-stitching a replica
OL,17,F"I was absolutely blown away by it,"
OL,18,Fone of the first people to see it in
OL,19,Fthe British Museum says. But others
OL,20,Ftell us the event is "out of reach" due
OL,21,Fto ticket costs and London location
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
